\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. YE that do your Master's will,
\par Meek in heart, be meeker still:
\par Day by day your sins confess,
\par Ye that walk in righteousness:
\par Gracious souls in grace abound,
\par Seek the Lord, whom ye have found.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Sing ye happy souls, that press
\par Toward the height of holiness;
\par All His promises receive,
\par All the grace He Hath to give;
\par Follow on, nor slack your pace
\par Till ye see His glorious face.
\par 
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

